<?php
/**
* Information on how to obtain the "Code key"
*/
?>
<div class="postbox" style="background:#3c763d;color:#fff;">
    <h3 style="color:yellow;"><span style="font-weight: 800">How to get the "Code key"</span></h3>

    <div class="inside">
        <ol>
			<li>Log into your DigitalPUSH account here : <a href="https://digitalpush.org/login.php" target=_blank style="color:yellow;">Login</a></li>
			<li>In the main navigation hover the "Websites" section then select "Get code" <a href="https://digitalpush.org/member/get_code.php" target=_blank style="color:yellow;">Get code</a></li>
			<li>Select your domain name from the list or if you haven't added your website yet, do so through the "New website" page (adding a new website is instant), then click the "Confirm selection" button. </li>
			<li>Select <b>WordPress integration</b> for the <b>Integration type</b> field.</li>
			<li>Copy / Paste the "Code key" from the field with the same name.</li>
        </ol>

    </div>
</div>
